# …but the operator console's entry document is real source, not a build
# artifact. The blanket *.html above silently swallowed it (which is why the
# console shipped without an index.html). Keep this negation.
!src/cofounder_agent/console/index.html

# NOTE: web/public-site/ (the branded frontend) is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is tracked source — Vercel deploys it from this repo. Privacy vs the
# public poindexter mirror is enforced by scripts/sync-to-github.sh, which
# strips it during the mirror rebuild. A blanket ignore here only booby-traps
# new site files (same failure mode as the *.html/console incident above);
# junk is covered by web/public-site/.gitignore (node_modules, .next, etc.).


